#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:15
msgid "PVS-Studio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:17
msgid ""
"**PVS-Studio** is a static code analysis tool for detecting bugs and "
"security weaknesses in the source code of programs, written in C, C++, C# "
"and Java. It analyzes source code intended for 32-bit, 64-bit and embedded "
"ARM platforms. The official page can be found `here  <https://www.viva64.com/"
"en/pvs-studio/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:23
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:26
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:28
msgid ""
"**PVS-Studio** performs a wide range of code checks, and it is also useful "
"in finding misprints and Copy-Paste errors. These checks are static analysis "
"checks that can be performed at a source code level. Some of the defects "
"that might be detected include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:32
msgid "Arithmetic over/underflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:33
msgid "Array index out of bounds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:34
msgid "Undefined/unspecified behavior"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:35
msgid "Incorrect usage of exceptions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:36
msgid "Buffer overrun"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:37
msgid "Null pointer/null reference dereference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:38
msgid "Improper understanding of function/class operation logic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:39
msgid "Illegal bitwise/shift operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/pvs-studio.rst:41
msgid ""
"The full list of supported checks can be found on `the official webpage  "
"<https://www.viva64.com/en/w/>`__."
msgstr ""

